# Ethics Vibe Check — contributor overview

User-triggered MCP gut-check for bias, sycophancy, and conversation drift. Not ambient automatic oversight.

## Tools
- `ethics_check` / `critical_thinking` — second-opinion scans; return `sessionTrend` when a session id is available (explicit or process default)
- `ethics_guide` — dilemma guidance
- `ethics_learn` — manual concern log (usually unnecessary with autoStore)
- `ethics_feedback` — thumbs-up/down on prior recommendations

## Key paths
- Server: [src/index.ts](mdc:src/index.ts)
- Providers: [src/utils/llm.ts](mdc:src/utils/llm.ts) (`gemini` | `ollama` | `mock`)
- Storage / drift: [src/utils/storage.ts](mdc:src/utils/storage.ts)
- Session default: [src/utils/session.ts](mdc:src/utils/session.ts)
- Companion skill: [skills/ethics-vibe-check/SKILL.md](mdc:skills/ethics-vibe-check/SKILL.md)

## Verify
- `npm run test:session`
- `npm run test:calibration` (mock provider)
